{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_204_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，王正月，叔孫婼如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"二、癸丑，叔鞅卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"三、晉人執我行人叔孫婼。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"四、晉人圍郊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"五、夏，六月，蔡侯東國卒於楚。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"六、秋，七月，莒子庚與來奔。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"七、戊辰，吳敗頓、胡、沈、蔡、陳、許之師於雞甫，胡子髠、沈子盈滅。獲陳夏齧。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"中國不言敗，此其言敗何也？中國不敗，胡子髠、沈子盈其滅乎？其言敗，釋其滅也。獲者，非與之辭也，上下之稱也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"八、天王居於狄泉。尹氏立王子朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"始王也。其曰天王，因其居而王之也。立者，不宜立者也。朝之不名何也？別嫌乎尹氏之朝也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"九、八月，乙未，地震。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"十、冬，公如晉，至河，有疾，乃復。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_204_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_204","textTraditional":"疾不志，此其志何也？釋不得入乎晉也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}